[[0,931474,0,3,0,3,"2016-03-20T11:57:22","YAlmeida","",[],"<p>Good evening,</p>\n<p>I am writing to you for careers advice; so I can appropriately plan my education, working towards my chosen career.</p>\n<p>I am currently studying GCSEs in Business, Spanish and History.\nThese are the subjects I feel passionate about and have a natural aptitude for.\nI'm unsure which of these subjects I wish to persue as the primary area of my career; and would like to explore what my options are for each of them as my primary focus.</p>\n<p>Example:</p>\n<p>A) Business as primary focus:\nIntegrating Spanish to allow for international business relations abroad.\nIntegrating History: knowledge in this area making it the business focus.\nE.g. commerse </p>\n<p>B) Spanish:\nLanguage focused career, \nIntegrating business  (e.g. running a language school)\nIntegrating History (e.g. ensuring ethical education standards are adhered to)</p>\n<p>I would like some guidance into possible career options catarogised in this way; in order to seek work experience in appropriate sectors and build on key skills relevant to the field.</p>\n<p>C) History:\nIncorporating Spanish\nIncorporating Business</p>\n<p>Please ignore my specific examples (for example I don't necessarily want to work in education) I would like only to know what my available options are before I make the next steps toward the one I choose.</p>\n<p>Many thanks, and I look forward to hearing from you.\n</p>","16yr old seeks future.","","CareerGuidance"]]